tantra3 is-system-concept

-- true if a concept name is internal (not a user entity).
-- system concepts: count, count-total, count-remaining, viveka-max, viveka-min.
-- these are pipeline-internal nodes, not things the user mentioned.

takes w

result = member w ["count", "count-total", "count-remaining", "viveka-max", "viveka-min"]

return result

done
